@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@tenantA = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@tenantB = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

### Create employee (tenant A)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/employees
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Ahmed",
  "lastName": "Ali",
  "email": "ahmed.ali@example.com",
  "department": "Engineering",
  "status": "Active",
  "customData": { "level": "Senior", "remote": true },
  "salary": { "amountMinor": 2500000, "currencyCode": "EGP" }
}

### List employees (tenant A)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/employees?page=1&pageSize=10&department=Engineering
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantA}}

### List employees (tenant B) - should not see tenant A data
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/employees
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantB}}

### Missing tenant header
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/employees
